    <p>Several enhancements serve as prerequisites for <a href="/docs/en/security/frontier-security/">Frontier Security</a> structures: E1 &rarr; N1 (CGS), E3 &rarr; N2 (FIL), E5 &rarr; N7 (CQN).</p>
